{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Do not recreate a parent that ended in an earlier invocation.** `endedOperationIds` is invocation-local, so a callback or invoke completed after its direct context finished previously is parented to that context\u2019s deterministic span ID despite ending later. Consult operation history and timestamps, falling back to `Workflow` when a terminal direct parent predates the completion, and add a cross-invocation regression test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs7-EQxB","finding_digest":"c4e807746abf7c339d92c69579449ce4a8d2dc101028b9a7d9a74c854725d94b","finding_id":"arf_v1_ytuao5dkx56dhhmsy2kxsre44s","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/execution-plugin.ts::resolveoperationparentcontext::ended-parent-containment","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/execution-plugin.ts::resolveoperationparentcontext::ended-parent-containment","line":725,"observation_digest":"d670bca0feef6a690bd6cf9b0aac685762401b425893660eeaaf244dab4e1f37","observation_id":"aro_v1_2zylzih655vgsc6wz6nqvldik5","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/execution-plugin.ts","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_ytuao5dkx56dhhmsy2kxsre44s","published_at":"2026-10-13T18:33:35Z","review_id":"arr_v1_kzxp7vt5lvpz3ub6fqkp2wcw4s","reviewed_base_sha":"89011d8369d00ba0f6ddb49d850f73d1e864d96d","reviewed_head_sha":"60295b7375ffd570073dbfb6132c4b891af7d6a3","reviewer":"codex","start_line":719,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":960},"record_id":"art_v1_c4tacjuxxhvsmnobh7gdwtw3n2","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-13T18:33:35Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
